# CRUD API

## Plugin semantics

CRUD provides API-oriented listeners (e.g. Api, ApiPagination, JsonApi — verify which are enabled in the project). Use installed listeners and project API conventions together.

## Required behavior

- Inspect which CRUD API listeners the app loads before adding response shaping.
- Keep serialization exposure tight (hidden fields, mass assignment).
- Do not invent Laravel Resource/API Resource patterns.

## Anti-patterns

- Reimplementing API pagination envelopes when CRUD API listeners already provide them
- Assuming Search listener behavior without `friendsofcake/search` (separate extension)
